description:
Delete a Channel

This endpoint deletes a Channel. Applies to Channels tied to a Space, Folder, or List or not tied to locations.

ClickUp API v3: DELETE /api/v3/workspaces/{workspace_id}/chat/channels/{channel_id}

Delete a message

This endpoint deletes a message.

ClickUp API v3: DELETE /api/v3/workspaces/{workspace_id}/chat/messages/{message_id}

Delete a message reaction

This endpoint deletes a message reaction.

ClickUp API v3: DELETE /api/v3/workspaces/{workspace_id}/chat/messages/{message_id}/reactions/{reaction}

Retrieve a Channel

This endpoint retrieves a specific Channel given its ID.

ClickUp API v3: GET /api/v3/workspaces/{workspace_id}/chat/channels/{channel_id}

Update a Channel

This endpoint updates a single Channel.

ClickUp API v3: PATCH /api/v3/workspaces/{workspace_id}/chat/channels/{channel_id}

Update a message

This endpoint updates a message.

ClickUp API v3: PATCH /api/v3/workspaces/{workspace_id}/chat/messages/{message_id}

Delete Comment

Delete a task comment.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/comment/{comment_id}

Update Comment

Replace the content of a task commment, assign a comment, and mark a comment as resolved.

ClickUp API v2: PUT /api/v2/comment/{comment_id}

Remove Custom Field Value

Remove the data from a Custom Field on a task. This does not delete the option from the Custom Field.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/task/{task_id}/field/{field_id}

Edit a Page

Edit a page in a Doc.

ClickUp API v3: PUT /api/v3/workspaces/{workspace_id}/docs/{doc_id}/pages/{page_id}

Fetch a Doc

View information about a Doc.

ClickUp API v3: GET /api/v3/workspaces/{workspace_id}/docs/{doc_id}

Get page

View the information about a page in a Doc. Due to markdown format limitations, some content elements [will not be displayed exactly as they appear in ClickUp](doc:docsimportexportlimitations/).

ClickUp API v3: GET /api/v3/workspaces/{workspace_id}/docs/{doc_id}/pages/{page_id}

Delete Folder

Delete a Folder from your Workspace.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/folder/{folder_id}

Delete Goal

Remove a Goal from your Workspace.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/goal/{goal_id}

Delete Key Result

Delete a target from a Goal.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/key_result/{key_result_id}

Edit Key Result

Update a Target.

ClickUp API v2: PUT /api/v2/key_result/{key_result_id}

Get Goal

View the details of a Goal including its Targets.

ClickUp API v2: GET /api/v2/goal/{goal_id}

Update Goal

Rename a Goal, set the due date, replace the description, add or remove owners, and set the Goal color.

ClickUp API v2: PUT /api/v2/goal/{goal_id}

Delete List

Delete a List from your Workspace.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/list/{list_id}

Get List

View information about a List.

ClickUp API v2: GET /api/v2/list/{list_id}

Update List

Rename a List, update the List Info description, set a due date/time, set the List's priority, set an assignee, set or remove the List color.

ClickUp API v2: PUT /api/v2/list/{list_id}

Delete Space

Delete a Space from your Workspace.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/space/{space_id}

Get Space

View the Spaces available in a Workspace.

ClickUp API v2: GET /api/v2/space/{space_id}

Update Space

Rename, set the Space color, and enable ClickApps for a Space.

ClickUp API v2: PUT /api/v2/space/{space_id}

Add Tag To Task

Add a Tag to a task.

ClickUp API v2: POST /api/v2/task/{task_id}/tag/{tag_name}

Delete Space Tag

Delete a task Tag from a Space.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/space/{space_id}/tag/{tag_name}

Edit Space Tag

Update a task Tag.

ClickUp API v2: PUT /api/v2/space/{space_id}/tag/{tag_name}

Remove Tag From Task

Remove a Tag from a task. This does not delete the Tag from the Space.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/task/{task_id}/tag/{tag_name}

Delete Checklist

Delete a checklist from a task.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/checklist/{checklist_id}

Delete Checklist Item

Delete a line item from a task checklist.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/checklist/{checklist_id}/checklist_item/{checklist_item_id}

Edit Checklist

Rename a task checklist, or reorder a checklist so it appears above or below other checklists on a task.

ClickUp API v2: PUT /api/v2/checklist/{checklist_id}

Add Task Link

This is the equivalent of the feature _Task Links_ in the right-hand sidebar of a Task.  It allows you to link two tasks together. General links or links to other objects than tasks are not supported.

ClickUp API v2: POST /api/v2/task/{task_id}/link/{links_to}

Delete Task Link

Remove the link between two tasks.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/task/{task_id}/link/{links_to}

Create Task From Template

Create a new task using a task template defined in your workspace. Publicly shared templates must be [added to your Workspace](https://help.clickup.com/hc/en-us/articles/6326023965591-Add-a-template-to-your-library) before you can use them with the public API.

ClickUp API v2: POST /api/v2/list/{list_id}/taskTemplate/{template_id}

Delete Task

Delete a task from your Workspace.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/task/{task_id}

Update Task

Update a task by including one or more fields in the request body.

ClickUp API v2: PUT /api/v2/task/{task_id}

Delete a time Entry

Delete a time entry from a Workspace.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/team/{team_id}/time_entries/{timer_id}

Delete time tracked

***Note:** This is a legacy time tracking endpoint. We recommend using the Time Tracking API endpoints to manage time entries.*

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/task/{task_id}/time/{interval_id}

Edit time tracked

***Note:** This is a legacy time tracking endpoint. We recommend using the Time Tracking API endpoints to manage time entries.*

ClickUp API v2: PUT /api/v2/task/{task_id}/time/{interval_id}

Update a time Entry

Update the details of a time entry.

ClickUp API v2: PUT /api/v2/team/{team_id}/time_entries/{timer_id}

Get View

View information about a specific task or page view. The information returned about a view varies by the type of view.

ClickUp API v2: GET /api/v2/view/{view_id}

Update View

Rename a view, update the grouping, sorting, filters, columns, and settings of a view.

ClickUp API v2: PUT /api/v2/view/{view_id}

Delete Webhook

Delete a webhook to stop monitoring the events and locations of the webhook.

ClickUp API v2: DELETE /api/v2/webhook/{webhook_id}

Update Webhook

Update a webhook to change the events to be monitored.

ClickUp API v2: PUT /api/v2/webhook/{webhook_id}
